---
import SectionHeading from "../shared/SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section class="border-t border-slate-100 bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20 md:py-28">
    <SectionHeading
      eyebrow="What Changes For You"
      headline="You stop guessing at what to fix next."
      subhead="Decisions get made faster, and with more confidence — because they're grounded in where your business actually is."
    />
    <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-lg text-slate-600">
      EverCompass gives you a clear set of priorities: what's constraining
      growth, what to fix first, what to leave alone for now. EverJourneys builds
      and improves the specific pieces that list calls for — whether you want a
      strategic plan, hands-on execution, or ongoing optimization of what's
      already built. However you engage, the diagnosis doesn't sit on a shelf as
      a document. It becomes the thing that actually gets built.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
